Lab 20: Comprehensive Review and Final Project
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Deploy and configure a complete Ansible Automation Platform environment using AWX
Configure inventories, credentials, and projects in the Automation Controller
Create and execute job templates and workflows using best practices
Monitor job execution and troubleshoot common automation and connectivity failures
Implement role-based access control (RBAC) with organizations, teams, users, and permissions
